   "script_line": "Why do we make you learn square metres? Because of this situation. A guest asks: “does the two-bedroom house work for us with the children?” Two answers are possible. The vague one — “yes, I think so” — leaves the guest where they were. The precise one: “yes, and if they are small the sofa bed in the living room gives you room to spare; the second bedroom can be twins or a double, tell me which you prefer.” That answer has just built trust. And trust is the currency of this business.",
