   "script_line": "Now the standard, and here the tone changes. A standard is a promise we made to every future guest, based on what we delivered to the past ones. The guest paid for the Craveiral of the photographs and the reviews. Every detail right keeps that promise: the flawless bed, the kitchen without a mark, the inviting terrace, the amenities complete. Every detail wrong breaks it a little. Broken promises pile up in silence: guests rarely complain about small things — they think less of us quietly, book elsewhere one day, and we never know why.",
